        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The main middle section of the insect body comprising three thoracic rings: the pro-, the meso- and the metathoraces which are more or less well fused and cask-like sometimes having on the upper lateral part one of two pairs of wings, while on the ventrolateral part each thoracic ring bears a pair of legs.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0166419</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


