        <owl:annotatedTarget>Contiguous region of early embryonic cells that will invaginate to form the mesoderm during gastrulation (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0089570</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
