    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001102 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001102">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005097"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005137"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00025993"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001919"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002202"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005554"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Region of the larval central nervous system posterior to the gnathal neuromeres (Clark et al., 2018; Eschbach and Zlatic, 2020; Miroschnikow et al., 2020). It consists of three thoracic neuromeres, eight abdominal neuromeres and a terminal plexus (Clark et al., 2018).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>FBbt:00001971</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00001102</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>larval ventral ganglion</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>vnc</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ventral cord</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00001102</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur"/>
        <rdfs:comment>There is some inconsistency in the literature as to whether the larval gnathal ganglion is a part of the ventral nerve cord, many recent papers consider it to be a distinct region, so it is not included here.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>larval ventral nerve cord</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001102"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Region of the larval central nervous system posterior to the gnathal neuromeres (Clark et al., 2018; Eschbach and Zlatic, 2020; Miroschnikow et al., 2020). It consists of three thoracic neuromeres, eight abdominal neuromeres and a terminal plexus (Clark et al., 2018).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0238752</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0246261</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0247585</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001103 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001103">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005104"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00047551"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002134"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001102"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Larval connective that extends in an anterior-posterior direction along the larval ventral nerve cord. These tracts continue forward into the subesophageal zone and bend laterally following the outline of the esophageal foramen (Hartenstein et al., 2018). They then converge, with their fibers forming a complex system of anastomoses before continuing into tracts of the supraesophageal ganglion (Hartenstein et al., 2017).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1897</obo:IAO_0000233>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00001103</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>embryonic/larval longitudinal connective</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>longitudinal tract of ventral nerve cord</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>ventral nerve connective</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00001103</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur"/>
        <rdfs:label>larval longitudinal connective</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Larval connective that extends in an anterior-posterior direction along the larval ventral nerve cord. These tracts continue forward into the subesophageal zone and bend laterally following the outline of the esophageal foramen (Hartenstein et al., 2018). They then converge, with their fibers forming a complex system of anastomoses before continuing into tracts of the supraesophageal ganglion (Hartenstein et al., 2017).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0160715</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0215457</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0237252</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>longitudinal tract of ventral nerve cord</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0237252</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001103"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>ventral nerve connective</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0215457</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001104 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001104">
        <owl:equivalentClass>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00049998"/>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002131"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001727"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00047551"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00049998"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001102"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Commissure of the ventral nerve cord at late embryonic or larval stages. There are two main commissures per segment, anterior and posterior, but the posterior commissure is not present in A9 (Landgraf et al., 2003; Birkholz et al., 2015). In some segments, at some stages these can be further divided into multiple components along the dorsal-ventral axis (Truman et al., 2004; Birkholz et al., 2015; Hartenstein et al., 2018).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00001104</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00001104</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur"/>
        <rdfs:label>larval ventral nerve cord commissure</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001104"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Commissure of the ventral nerve cord at late embryonic or larval stages. There are two main commissures per segment, anterior and posterior, but the posterior commissure is not present in A9 (Landgraf et al., 2003; Birkholz et al., 2015). In some segments, at some stages these can be further divided into multiple components along the dorsal-ventral axis (Truman et al., 2004; Birkholz et al., 2015; Hartenstein et al., 2018).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0160715</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0180161</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0228122</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0237252</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


