        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Neuroblast that generates cells of the ventral nervous system, including interneurons, motor neurons and/or glial cells (Bossing et al., 1996). These neuroblasts derive from the ventral neurectoderm (Bossing et al., 1996).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00001369</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
