        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cluster of 4-9 larval oenocytes situated bilaterally in each of abdominal segments 1-7 in a space between the dorsoventral muscles and the body wall. Each cell group is closely associated with an &apos;abdominal lateral pentascolopidial chordotonal organ lch5&apos; and is supplied by its own tracheal branch.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00001695</oboInOwl:id>
