        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cluster of 4-9 larval oenocytes situated bilaterally in each of abdominal segments 1-7 in a space between the dorsoventral muscles and the body wall. Each cell group is closely associated with an &apos;abdominal lateral pentascolopidial chordotonal organ lch5&apos; and is supplied by its own tracheal branch.</owl:annotatedTarget>
