        <owl:annotatedTarget>Larval sensory neuron that fasciculates with a segmental nerve. In abdominal segments 1-7, these are the sensory neurons located in the ventral and ventral&apos; clusters (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997; Singhania and Grueber, 2014).</owl:annotatedTarget>
