            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Larval multidendritic neuron of the ventral&apos; sensory cluster of the prothoracic segment (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). There are four of these on each side, all of which have axons that fasciculate with the prothoracic segmental nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997).</obo:IAO_0000115>
