        <obo:IAO_0000028>Mi</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A columnar neuron that is intrinsic to the medulla, connecting distal and proximal layers (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989; Kind et al., 2021). It has its soma in the cell body rind of the medulla (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00003775</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
