        <obo:IAO_0000028>R6</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Outer photoreceptor cell of the adult eye whose rhabdomere is located at the right angle vertex of the shorter of the two parallel sides of the trapezoid of rhabdomeres in each ommatidium. It has a single axon that projects along a single lamina optic cartridge (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989; Wolff and Ready, 1993).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>FBbt:00003715</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CL:0000705</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00004223</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
