        <obo:IAO_0000115>One of the facets of the compound eye. It is composed of eight light-sensing photoreceptor cells (photoreceptor cell R1-R8) and accessory cells. There are around 800 ommatidia in each compound eye.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UBERON:0000971</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00004510</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
