            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The anterior-most, cup-shaped region of the lateral oviduct (Kapelnikov et al., 2008; McQueen et al., 2022). Formed by the joining together of the individual pedicels (small tubes coming from the base of each ovariole) (McQueen et al., 2022).</obo:IAO_0000115>
