        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Collective term for the masses and sheets of adipose tissue that are distributed throughout the organism&apos;s body. The adult and larval fat bodies are composed of different cell lineages, but perform the same main function of fat storage (Musselman and Kuhnlein, 2018).</owl:annotatedTarget>
