            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Stomodeal invagination in its later phase of growth during stages 11-12 as it extends caudally (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997).</obo:IAO_0000115>
