        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Structure formed by the male germline stem cells, cyst progenitor cells and the hub around which they are clustered and to which they are attached. It is located at the apical (blind) end of the testis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
