        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Region of the cell body rind overlying the mushroom body calyx (Ito et al., 2014). It contains the cell bodies of the Kenyon cells (Aso et al., 2009).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00007112</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
