        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00007112</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>rCAp is the only subregion of rCA listed in Ito et al. (2014) and no other mushroom body rinds are listed.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>cell body rind of adult mushroom body calyx</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
