        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001920"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002100"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00111226"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0013002"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007127"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An antennal lobe projection neuron that is part of the embryonic/larval brain. These neurons innervate the larval antennal lobe and send an axon to higher brain centers, typically including the larval antennal lobe. The soma of these neurons are located in a single, anterodorsal cluster lateral. Since all inputs to the larval antennal lobe are olfactory (Masuda-Nakagawa et al., 2008), these are olfactory projection neurons.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>VFB:FBbt_00007225</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>embryonic/larval antennal lobe projection neuron</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>fly_anatomy.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00007225</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>larval antennal lobe projection neuron</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007225"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An antennal lobe projection neuron that is part of the embryonic/larval brain. These neurons innervate the larval antennal lobe and send an axon to higher brain centers, typically including the larval antennal lobe. The soma of these neurons are located in a single, anterodorsal cluster lateral. Since all inputs to the larval antennal lobe are olfactory (Masuda-Nakagawa et al., 2008), these are olfactory projection neurons.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0147119</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0187327</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0208205</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


