        <obo:IAO_0000115>Subregion of the adult mushroom body vertical lobe (Ito et al., 2014). It is composed of the vertical branches of alpha&apos;/beta&apos; Kenyon cells (Ito et al., 2014).</obo:IAO_0000115>
