        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00040002</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#BrainName"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Despite the name, intended as a singular noun as in &quot;The United States&quot;.</rdfs:comment>
