        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Superior (dorsal) part of the posterior slope. It lies behind the great commissure, gorget and vest and below the inferior clamp and inferior bridge. It has no clear glial boundary with the surrounding neuropils.</obo:IAO_0000115>
