        <rdfs:comment>The SPS corresponds to part of the superior part of the psl of Otsuna and Ito (2006) and to the dorsal postcommissural ventromedial cerebrum (Ito et al., 2014).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>superior posterior slope</rdfs:label>
