        <obo:IAO_0000115>Thin sclerite connecting the epandrium (genital arch) to abdominal tergites 6 and 7 (Rice et al., 2019). Unlike other structures of the male terminalia, it develops from the female gential primordium (Keisman et al., 2001).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1364</obo:IAO_0000233>
