        <obo:IAO_0000115>Larval cell that is found slightly posterior to the centrally-located germ cells and anterior to the swarm cells in the late third instar ovary. These cells are the precursors of follicle stem cells and follicle cells in the adult.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705"/>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-01-16T11:01:18Z</dc:date>
