        <obo:IAO_0000115>Precursor cell of the adult midgut epithelium that is produced by an intestinal stem cell and is destined to become an enteroendocrine cell (Zeng and Hou, 2015; He et al., 2018). It can be stimulated to differentiate by mechanical signals (He et al., 2018).</obo:IAO_0000115>
