        <obo:IAO_0000028>KCg</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Gamma Kenyon cell of the adult mushroom body. It develops from a larval gamma Kenyon cell that is remodeled during the pupal stage (Lee et al., 1999; Kunz et al., 2012). It expresses sNPF (Johard et al., 2008; Barnstedt et al., 2016; Croset et al., 2018). There are around 700 neurons of this type per hemisphere (Li et al., 2020).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705"/>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-09-30T14:34:49Z</dc:date>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBrain_NDB:10474</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
