        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mushroom body neuron born in the late larva, after the gamma neurons (Lee et al., 1999). It projects via the pedunculus, into the medial and vertical lobes, forming an inner concentric layer, below the gamma neurons (Lee et al., 1999; Kurusu et al., 2002). It undergoes only minor alterations during metamorphosis (Lee et al., 1999).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705"/>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-10-01T15:14:15Z</dc:date>
