        <obo:IAO_0000115>Adult dopaminergic neuron that feeds reward or punishment information into the mushroom body, with dopamine release modifying the strength of Kenyon cell synapses to mushroom body output neurons (MBONs) in the same region (Li et al., 2020).</obo:IAO_0000115>
