        <oboInOwl:id>FBbt:00051303</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Ignores directionality of information flow, similar to &apos;adult ascending neuron&apos;. Excludes neurons that &apos;ascend&apos; from the gnathal neuromeres.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>larval ascending neuron</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
