            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Sensory neuron of the antenna that detects a stimulus via one or more receptors and projects to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2021). This includes antennal olfactory, thermosensory and hygrosensory neurons (Schlegel et al., 2021).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705"/>
