        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Sensory neuron of the antenna that detects a stimulus via one or more receptors and projects to the antennal lobe (Schlegel et al., 2021). This includes antennal olfactory, thermosensory and hygrosensory neurons (Schlegel et al., 2021).</owl:annotatedTarget>
