        <obo:IAO_0000115>Adult pheromone sensing neuron that has its soma and sensory dendrite in the mesothoracic leg (Thistle et al., 2012). There are approximately 18 of these per male mesothoracic leg (Toda et al., 2012).</obo:IAO_0000115>
