        <obo:IAO_0000115>An intrinsic columnar neuron of the visual system whose cell body is located in the medulla cortex and that has a main projection making wide-field arborizations in the lamina. It expresses the transcription factor Fer2 (Ozel et al., 2021) and is cholinergic (Davis et al., 2020).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718"/>
