        <obo:IAO_0000115>An embryonic/larval antennal lobe projection neuron that is cholinergic. These neurons constitute about 50% of the embryonic/larval antennal lobe projection neurons that have an anterodorsally located soma (Python and Stocker, 2002).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Simon-Reeve-2162827703"/>
