        <obo:IAO_0000115>Glial cell of the embryonic/larval peripheral nervous system that ensheathes axons and dendrites. The perineurial layer of glial cell lie on top of the inner, subperineurial glial cells (Banerjee et al., 2006).</obo:IAO_0000115>
