        <obo:IAO_0000115>Glutamatergic local interneuron of the adult antennal lobe. The minority of local interneurons of the adult antennal lobe fall into this class. Most of the cell bodies of these interneurons belong to the ventral neuroblast lineage, and a few to the lateral neuroblast lineage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
