        <rdfs:comment>At third instar, the medial lobe comprise three types of Kenyon cells: embryonic-born gamma neurons, larval-born gamma neurons and larval born alpha&apos;/beta&apos; neurons (Pauls et al., 2010).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>medial lobe of larval mushroom body</rdfs:label>
