        <owl:annotatedTarget>Neuropil mass below the esophagus in the adult brain. It encompasses the gnathal ganglion, the prow and the saddle.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0224194</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
