        <owl:annotatedTarget>Longitudinal fascicle of the larval ventral nerve cord found in a central position on the dorsal-ventral axis and an intermediate position on the medial-lateral axis (Landgraf et al., 2003). This fascicle is loosely organized, and contains three distinct tracts, the C1, C2 and C3 fascicles (Landgraf et al., 2003; Zlatic et al., 2003).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0160715</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
