            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Oogenesis stage that begins when the cyst leaves the germarium (from this point the cyst is referred to as an egg chamber). During this stage, polyploidation of the nurse cells begins, they reach a ploidy of 8C, and follicle cells start to divide.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>FlyBase_development_CV</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBdv:00005262</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Temporal ordering number - 10020.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>oogenesis stage S2</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
