            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Oogenesis stage which begins when yolk first appears in the oocyte. Follicle cell migration over the oocyte begins during this stage (although mostly occurs during stage 9).</obo:IAO_0000115>
