        <owl:annotatedTarget>Oogenesis stage that begins when the centripetal follicle cells begin to migrate. As a result, the vitelline membrane extends into the opercular region. This stage ends when nurse cell dumping begins.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0021038</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0034074</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
