            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Oogenesis stage that begins when dying nurse cells form an anterior cap to the oocyte. Shortly after this, nurse cell dumping and growth of the oocyte are complete. Elongation of the dorsal appendages and formation of the innermost chorionic layer and endochorion begins during this stage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>FlyBase_development_CV</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBdv:00005274</oboInOwl:id>
