        <owl:annotatedTarget>Oogenesis stage during which only 7-8 nurse cell nuclei remain at the anterior of the oocyte. At the beginning of this stage, oocyte chromosome bivalents separate from each other - indicating mid-prometaphase of oocyte meiosis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FlyBase:FBrf0029744</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
