            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Stage of the third larval instar during which the larva wanders out of the food and climbs. Under optimum conditions at 25&apos;C, this occurs approximately 24 hours after the start of the third instar larval stage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor rdf:resource="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172"/>
