        <obo:IAO_0000115>Dark green &apos;yellow body&apos; appears between the anterior ends of the two Malpighian tubule segments, mid-dorsally at the anterior of the abdomen. Duration at 25 degrees C: approximately 13 hours, 45 minutes. (138.7-152.4 hours after egg laying; 18.7-32.4 hours after puparium formation).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>green Malpighian tubules stage</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
