        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pharate adult stage P15 begins with the tanning of the tergites and ends with eclosion. Duration at 25 degrees C: approximately 8 hours, 30 minutes. (211.5-220 hours after egg laying; 91.5-100 hours after puparium formation).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pupal stage P15</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>FlyBase_development_CV</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
