            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Stage which starts when the operculum opens and ends when eclosion is completed. Duration at 25 degrees C: approximately 24 minutes. (219.6-220 hours after egg laying; 99.6-100 hours after puparium formation).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>eclosion stage</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pupal stage P15(ii)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
