            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The developing adult after pupal-adult apolysis, i.e.- from stage P8 (when yellow eye color first becomes visible through the pupal case), to eclosion. Duration at 25 degrees C: approximately 55.7 hours (164.3-220 hours after egg laying; 44.3-100 hours after puparium formation).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>FlyBase_development_CV</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>FBdv:00006011</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Temporal ordering number - 625.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>pharate adult stage</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
